---
// Style guide section: Finsweet
// Markup ported word for word from the original case-study.html.
---
<section class="section_style-guide-finsweet" data-pane="style-guide" id="sg-finsweet">
      <div class="padding-global padding-section-medium"><div class="container-large">
        <div class="heading_component is-narrow" data-anim=""><span class="text-style-eyebrow text-color-brand">11</span><h2 class="heading-style-h3">Finsweet</h2><p class="text-color-secondary">Interactions set with attributes in the Designer, so the team edits them without code. Scripts load once in the site head.</p></div>
        <div class="style-guide_attrs" data-anim-group="">
          <div class="style-guide_attr"><p class="heading-style-h4">Accordion</p><p class="text-size-small text-color-secondary">FAQ, one item open at a time</p><p class="style-guide_code">fs-accordion-element="group" · fs-accordion-single="true"</p><p class="style-guide_code">accordion · trigger · content · arrow</p></div>
          <div class="style-guide_attr"><p class="heading-style-h4">Modal</p><p class="text-size-small text-color-secondary">Upload, sample report, terms, privacy and cookie policy</p><p class="style-guide_code">fs-modal-element="modal · open · close"</p><p class="style-guide_code">fs-modal-instance="upload · report · terms · privacy · cookies"</p></div>
          <div class="style-guide_attr"><p class="heading-style-h4">Number count</p><p class="text-size-small text-color-secondary">The $10,000 card and the 3 stats</p><p class="style-guide_code">fs-numbercount-element="number"</p><p class="style-guide_code">fs-numbercount-end · locale="en-US" · duration</p></div>
          <div class="style-guide_attr"><p class="heading-style-h4">Range slider</p><p class="text-size-small text-color-secondary">The malpractice premium in the calculator</p><p class="style-guide_code">fs-rangeslider-element="wrapper · track · fill · handle · display-value"</p><p class="style-guide_code">min 5000 · max 40000 · step 1000 · start 15000</p></div>
          <div class="style-guide_attr"><p class="heading-style-h4">Cookie Consent</p><p class="text-size-small text-color-secondary">Opt-in banner and preferences</p><p class="style-guide_code">fs-cc="banner · allow · deny · open-preferences · preferences · submit"</p><p class="style-guide_code">fs-cc-checkbox="analytics · marketing"</p></div>
        </div>
      </div></div>
    </section>
